Privacy Policy

Last Updated: June 11, 2026

1. Introduction

This Privacy Policy explains how the Pokémon Support Bot ("Bot") collects, uses, stores, and protects information obtained through its operation within Discord.

2. Information We Collect

The Bot may collect and process the following information:

Discord Information
Discord User IDs
Discord Server IDs
Discord Channel IDs
Discord Message IDs
Support Information
Support ticket content
Messages submitted through support tickets
Attachments voluntarily submitted within tickets
Ticket status and history
Operational Information
Command usage data
Error logs
Moderation and support logs
Configuration settings related to server support systems
3. How We Use Information

Collected information may be used to:

Provide support services.
Manage and respond to support tickets.
Investigate reported issues.
Improve Bot functionality.
Maintain service security and stability.
Prevent abuse and misuse.
4. Data Storage

Information may be stored in databases, logs, or other storage systems operated by the Bot's administrators.

Data is retained only as long as reasonably necessary for operational, support, moderation, and security purposes.

5. Data Sharing

We do not sell user data.

Information may be accessible to:

Authorized bot developers.
Authorized support staff.
Authorized server administrators when necessary to handle support requests.

Information may also be disclosed if required by law or to protect the security and integrity of the service.

6. User Rights

Users may request:

Information regarding stored support data.
Deletion of support-related data where reasonably possible.

Some information may be retained when required for security, moderation, legal, or operational purposes.

7. Security

Reasonable measures are taken to protect collected information. However, no system can guarantee absolute security.

8. Children's Privacy

The Bot is intended for users who comply with Discord's minimum age requirements and applicable local laws.

9. Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically. Continued use of the Bot after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.

10. Contact

Questions regarding this Privacy Policy may be directed to the server staff or bot administrators through the designated support channels.
